   <system:String x:Key="OpenSeesDefaultGjTip">Fallback value for new manual members when GJ cannot be estimated from the section. An excessively large value can worsen matrix conditioning.</system:String>
   <system:String x:Key="OpenSeesAutoGjFromSectionLabel">Estimate GJ from the assigned section</system:String>
