    <system:String x:Key="FemSteelAutoLefEquivalent">Equivalent column about axis {0} (Maslennikov A.M., 2017, p. 218: bottom held laterally, end rotation springs r₁, r₂ and top-to-bottom sway spring r₃ taken from the mode that gives N_cr; r &lt; 0 — the surroundings load the element instead of restraining it): r₁ = {1} kN·m/rad, r₂ = {2} kN·m/rad, r₃ = {3} kN/m; EI = {4:0.###} kN·m², ρ₁ = r₁·l/EI = {5}, ρ₂ = r₂·l/EI = {6}, ρ₃ = r₃·l³/EI = {7}; root of the boundary-condition determinant nearest to N_cr: u = l·√(N_cr/EI) = {8:0.####}, μ = π/u = {9:0.###}; buckling load factor N_cr/N = {10:0.###}.</system:String>
