    <system:String x:Key="EtaEnabledHint">Multiplies the moment by the η coefficient per cl. 8.1.15 SP63.13330 when l0/i exceeds the slenderness limit (default 14, cl. 8.1.2) and the axial force is compressive.</system:String>
