    <system:String x:Key="EtaMuTableHint" xml:space="preserve">Effective length coefficient μ (l₀=μ·L) per cl. 8.1.17 SP63.13330:&#10;a) pinned at both ends — 1.0&#10;b) fixed at one end, free (cantilever) at the other — 2.0&#10;c) pinned, non-sway at one end, at the other:&#10;   — rigid fixity — 0.7&#10;   — flexible fixity — 0.9&#10;d) pinned, sway-permitting at one end, at the other:&#10;   — rigid fixity — 1.5&#10;   — flexible fixity — 2.0&#10;e) non-sway fixity at both ends:&#10;   — rigid — 0.5&#10;   — flexible — 0.8&#10;f) limited-sway fixity at both ends:&#10;   — rigid — 0.8&#10;   — flexible — 1.2</system:String>
