    <system:String x:Key="EtaSlendernessThresholdHint">Slenderness l₀/i (i — radius of gyration of the gross concrete section) above which the η correction applies. Defaults to 14 (cl. 8.1.2 SP63.13330) — can be refined for a specific structure.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="EtaSlendernessThresholdCustomHint">The limit is set manually and differs from 14. It is specified in l₀/i units (i — radius of gyration of the gross concrete section): in projects saved before the switch to l₀/i it meant l₀/h — check the value before calculating.</system:String>
