    <system:String x:Key="FemBucklingCombinationsLabel">Combinations</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="FemBucklingCombinationsHint">Each combination is a buckling problem of the undeformed model (SP 16 cl. 10.3.11): elastic sections, K_σ from the linear analysis forces. An element (structural member or chain of FEs) takes μ from the combination with the largest compression (cl. 10.3.2); modes, μ and buckling load factors are shown in the 3D view of the model, the steel check in “Auto (FEM)” mode takes μ from this analysis.</system:String>
