    <system:String x:Key="FemCsfeaRecordSelected">Selected steps:</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="FemCsfeaRecordStepsTip">Planned step numbers, counted through all stages (bisection substeps excluded), comma-separated, e.g. "5, 10, 15". The final step is always recorded.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="FemCsfeaRecordStageEnds">and stage ends</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="FemCsfeaRecordAll">All steps</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="FemCsfeaRecordAllTip">Fields of every step — the database grows in proportion to the number of steps.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="FemCsfeaRecordStrains">Record section strains</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="FemCsfeaRecordStrainsTip">Section strains (ε₀, κy, κz of bars; εx … κxy of plates) in every field record — for the “Section state” window; records become about twice as large. Section stiffnesses are always recorded.</system:String>
